SCOPE. This licence covers the code in this repository: the build, the tools,
the tests and the page's own markup, styles and prose.

It does NOT cover the food composition data. The files under tools/evidence/
and src/data/evidence.json are derived from national food composition
programmes and published research, and each carries the terms its publisher
set. Those terms are recorded per source in the `licence` field of
tools/evidence/sources.json, and summarised in tools/evidence/LICENCES.md.
They are not all as permissive as this licence. Some permit commercial use and
some do not; one carries a ShareAlike condition. Read them before reusing the
data, because this licence cannot grant what those publishers did not.

